PipeRead "yk-applications-menu"

*ToolBox: Colorset 0
*ToolBox: Columns 3
*ToolBox: Frame 1
*Toolbox: Padding 6 4
*ToolBox: ButtonGeometry 64x21+10-10
*ToolBox: (1x3, Swallow "ykclock" `Exec ykclock -led "#ff0067" -12`)
*ToolBox: (2x1, Right, Icon $./images/menu\_plus.png, Title (Side, Left) "Applications ", Action (Mouse 1) `Menu YKMenu rectangle $widthx$height+$left+$top +$widthp-5p +1>
*ToolBox: (2x1, Title (Side, Left) "Preferences ", Action (Mouse 1) `Menu PrefsMenu rectangle $widthx$height+$left+$top +$widthp-5p +1p`)
*ToolBox: (2x1, Right, Icon $./images/menu_plus.png, Title (Side, Left) "System ", Action (Mouse 1) `Menu SysMenu rectangle $widthx$height+$left+$top +$widthp-5p +1p`)
*ToolBox: (3x1, Left, Padding 2 2, Swallow "stalonetray" `Exec stalonetray --parent-bg --icon-gravity NW --geometry 1x1+0+0 --icon-size 16`)


AddToMenu SysMenu
+ "Logout" Exec ykSessionDialog --logout
+ "Reboot" Exec ykSessionDialog --reboot
+ "Shutdown" Exec ykSessionDialog --shutdown
  Style ToolBox !Button 1, !Button 2, !Button 3, !Button 4, !Button 5, !Button 6, !Button 7, !Button 8, !Button 9, !Button 0, FixedSize, !Maximizable, !Iconifiable, Window, !Handles, !Closeable, WindowListSkip, CirculateSkip

AddToFunc StartFunction

+ I Module FvwmButtons ToolBox
